  "executive_briefing": "The cryptocurrency ecosystem in late August 2026 is anchored by structural regulatory developments and evolving layer-1 execution paradigms. The advancing CLARITY Act (H.R. 3633) in the U.S. Senate provides unified market structure guidelines, granting long-term legal certainty for digital asset securities and smart contract development. Institutional adoption of spot Bitcoin has transitioned into a mature phase, with ETF asset pools exceeding $100B and corporate treasuries systematically absorbing supply. In technical execution, Ethereum maintains its EVM and DeFi dominance, while Bitcoin-native execution environments and non-custodial threshold-signature liquidity networks continue to mature, enabling seamless multi-chain interoperability between BTC and ETH without reliance on centralized wrappers.",
